{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, grab and handle it. If incomplete, repair it. If not visible, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectHandlingArea    /> <Action ID = HandleObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRepairStation    /> <Action ID = RepairObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectIncomplete    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = FindAndHandleObject    />",
